    paste0(
        "**4) Behind the Numbers: What\u2019s Causing Growth in Food Prices**<br>",
        "Fradella / Statistics Canada (2022)<br>",
        "[Link](https://www150.statcan.gc.ca/n1/pub/62f0014m/62f0014m2022014-eng.htm)"
